Subject: [M150] [turbofan] Fix self-referential DeadValue in
 EscapeAnalysisReducer

Original change's description:
> [turbofan] Fix self-referential DeadValue in EscapeAnalysisReducer
>
> EscapeAnalysisReducer::Finalize created DeadValue(load) before replacing
> uses of load with dead_value, which rewrote dead_value's own input to
> itself. Because of this cycle, dead_value could not be scheduled and
> mapped to an invalid OpIndex when lowering a consuming Phi in
> Turboshaft, causing an out-of-bounds access in the OperationBuffer.
>
> Fixed: 579278668
> Change-Id: Ia3e7fbc3c94994f5da3a202672509b2f39b6c520
> Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/v8/v8/+/8722294
